        "id": 1146974
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-01-12T06:19:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think it makes sense. \u0027device_specific: true\u0027 is for vendor modules. If we make that work, adding \u0027vendor_available: true\u0027 to a \u0027device_specific: true\u0027 module must create a core variant because of the \u0027vendor_available: true\u0027.",
      "parentUuid": "5de3728a_4585d186",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 12,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 12,
        "endChar": 37
      },
      "revId": "b9dcda30a922fb37a9bf5f2ba7bccd485fa12a9c",
